---
layout: null
permalink: /search.json
---
{%- comment -%}
  本文件参与 polyglot 本地化，每种语言各生成一份，只含该语言的文章。
  此前三语共用一份且用 posts_all，结果里只有 en+zh——日文搜索恒为 0 结果。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign lang = site.active_lang | default: site.default_lang -%}
{%- if lang == site.default_lang -%}{%- assign prefix = "" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign prefix = "/" | append: lang -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign posts = site.posts | where: "lang", lang -%}
[
  {% for post in posts %}
    {
      "title"    : "{{ post.title | escape }}",
      "url"      : "{{ prefix }}{{ post.url }}",
      "lang"     : "{{ post.lang }}",
      "category" : "{{ post.category }}",
      "tags"     : "{{ post.tags | join: ', ' }}",
      "date"     : "{{ post.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}",
      "excerpt"  : "{{ post.excerpt | strip_html | strip_newlines | escape }}"
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
]
